{"parentUuid":"984b2d04-a191-41bc-b8da-e7f6beef5ea8","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14474436 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"5d43b0ea-f23f-42ef-bc81-68b36deb27de","timestamp":"2026-10-25T04:34:36.501Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14474436 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-b2-staleness","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
{"parentUuid":"5d43b0ea-f23f-42ef-bc81-68b36deb27de","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgNLEg8U8xyAiNQKqhaAS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's where things stand.\n\n**I was wrong about brain having no findings, and the correction matters.** The gate's trail URL carries a *repo-scoped* number; I queried it as a *project* number, got back a dependabot bump on `cli`, and read its \"no open changes\" as a clean review. Real state: **8 open findings across 4 PRs, 4 of them current** — and all four are mine.\n\n**Finished this turn:**\n\n- **#484** — pushed the `--graph-binary` diagnostic (a bare provider plugin is now named as the cause instead of degrading silently), then fixed its current finding myself: the probe memo cached *failures*, so one timeout permanently marked a supporting provider unsupported. Now only a definitive answer is cached. I also acted on a stale-but-correct finding: `unreliable` can only name paths the answer returned records for, and an ancestor store has already dropped exactly those — so it's structurally empty in the common case. `excluded_records` existed upstream and was being thrown away at the boundary; it now reaches the emitted block. Gate running.\n- **#483 and #477** were the only two conflicted PRs (main's COR-2268 moved the read bounds and `resolveLocalTargetRepoDir` into `internal/base` and exported them). Both resolved, re-proved by weakening, pushed, now `MERGEABLE`. All 13 are conflict-free.\n- **A real gap #477's merge exposed:** unwiring the check from doctor left *every* guard in its test file green — they all called the function directly, so none observed the call site. Added a seam and a guard that goes red when the call is deleted. I then swept #482 for the same shape; it was already covered.\n\n**Delegated** the remaining three current findings (#489, #483, #477). #489's is the worst and it's my own over-correction: I turned a refusal into partition-and-warn and made a transient git failure silently publish a shrunken corpus — worse than the refusal I removed.\n\nTwo process notes I've recorded, because both nearly let bad work through: a weakening that fails to *compile* prints `[build failed]`, which greps as `^FAIL` and looks exactly like the guard firing — it isn't, the test never ran. And a misaddressed query returning \"no open changes\" is indistinguishable from a clean result.\n\nI've told the graph session brain is **not** final yet and to hold its fresh-env check until these four land. Their sequential-integration ask is queued behind them — three of the four touch the `export.go` family the integration branch has to combine anyway. Still only Approvals on the PRs themselves; I haven't asked and won't."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1081,"cache_read_input_tokens":249220,"output_tokens":852,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1081,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":852,"cache_read_input_tokens":249220,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1081,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1081},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"94961826-5b46-4e58-9e85-2c1686f9adf2","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgNLEfnNdqBhdKYqTt8wd","requestRef":"e83e0ae0-8baf-4f3c-9edf-0f1b1baec724","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"0de62610-930a-420f-88be-a9c83137a0bc","timestamp":"2026-10-25T04:34:50.177Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba