 rather than assumed green:\n\n- **#473** `workspace.go` — `loadWorkspaceManifest` is gone; resolved to keep `pass++` and\n  take the manifest from `workspaceStore(...).LoadManifest`. Deleting `pass++` turns\n  `TestWorkspaceWatchStampsEveryLineWithClockAndRepo` red, so the attribution this PR exists\n  for is still load-bearing.\n- **#477** `lifecycle_ops.go` — `resolveLocalTargetRepoDir` moved to `internal/base`.\n- **#483** `history.go` — the read bounds and the size-refusal error moved to\n  `internal/base` and were exported.\n\n## What this run does NOT cover\n\n`-race` and Windows, which is the point of pushing it: CI owns both, and no local run in this\nsession could reach them. The 10m default `go test` alarm is also worth knowing about here —\n`internal/cli` is 232s idle but 805–855s under parallel load, and `test:prepush` passes no\n`-timeout` while CI uses 20m.\nEOF\ngh pr create --repo entireio/entire-brain --draft --base main --head integration/brain-13-do-not-merge --title \"DO NOT MERGE: CI run of all 13 open brain PRs combined, in merge order\" --body-file \"$S/integ-pr-body.md\" 2>&1 | tail -3","description":"Open the draft integration PR"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"72f75b5b-fa67-48ee-b64c-01d77b7d535b","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgNRZBiYRjmG2oFxxMwXb","requestRef":"2affdb3d-3116-40b1-8bd8-6c47774b6bfc","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"8f740dd0-ec6d-4265-a807-45cc644355ca","timestamp":"2026-10-25T05:44:43.062Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-history-oversize","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
