d the export **fails** instead of dropping the session. Full\nclones are unaffected: absent there is absent for good, and they still partition.\n\n**The detail worth keeping.** Detection is one local config read matched by **suffix** across\nevery remote (`config --get-regexp \\\\.promisor$`), because `cli`'s checkpoint repository names\nits promisor remote by URL — `remote.https://github.com/entireio/cli-checkpoints.git.promisor`\n— and does **not** set `extensions.partialclone`. A detector written against\n`remote.origin.promisor` or that extension passes every fake-runner test and misses the only\nrepository the guard exists for. Pinned against real git for that reason: narrowing the\npattern to `origin` turns the real-git test red while the fake-runner tests stay green.\n\n'''\ns = s[:start] + new7 + s[end:]\nopen(p,\"w\").write(s)\nprint(\"section 7 rewritten as closed\")\nPY\nrtk proxy grep -n \"^## \" DECISIONS-FOR-YOU.md | tail -3","description":"Rewrite section 7 as closed"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"0d6ed6b4-55af-4bb8-ac0d-4f39c8802d1d","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgNS5rE8te43YhGkTSk4C","requestRef":"7fc2723e-7d76-4a12-9c2f-f365b906e37d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"b29eea1e-8fb7-4966-9fd0-3ad727f98556","timestamp":"2026-10-25T05:51:33.218Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-vanished","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
