er agents are running suites right now. Grep for `--- FAIL` and the recorded EXIT; never trust a bare exit code over an unread log.\n\nThen commit (conventional subject; body states what main extracted, what you kept, the weakening; NO AI/Claude attribution footer) and `git push origin fix/history-index-tolerates-oversize`.\n\nEnv: FORCE_COLOR=3 is set here and fails colour-assert tests on correct code — reproduce on main before believing one. Never bare `git stash` (shared across worktrees).\n\nREPORT caveman-ultra compressed: conflicted hunks + resolution; renames followed in tests; the weakening and its exact `--- FAIL` line; gate EXIT + FAIL count + package count; commit SHA; anything unverified."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2225,"cache_read_input_tokens":442104,"output_tokens":1893,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2225,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1893,"cache_read_input_tokens":442104,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2225,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2225},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01RmXGjd5dKWP5nK4XHH3HGY":{"description":"Merge main into 483","model":"sonnet","prompt":"Resolve ONE mechanical merge conflict on an open PR. Work ONLY in /Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-history-oversize (branch `fix/history-index-tolerates-oversize`, PR entireio/entire-brain#483). Touch no other repo or worktree. Do NOT merge to main, do NOT open a PR, do NOT request review, do NOT rebase. This branch ALREADY has an older main merged in; merging again