{"parentUuid":"74e12ee8-fe91-4f0a-9ea6-131162bd58d8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgNTgfxLw2qrJTehxX2Rq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All three hunks now verified by eye — `clibase.` (main's alias) paired with the branch's sentinel at 1433/1444/1501, plus `clibase.SafeReadAll` at 1508 and the sentinel wrap at 1514. The resolution is complete and correct; only the commit is blocked.\n\nUpdating the graph session, which doesn't need Bash:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1141,"cache_read_input_tokens":488022,"output_tokens":1523,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":210},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1141,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1523,"cache_read_input_tokens":488022,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1141,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1141},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"54189828-8c6b-4aad-9dc2-7c85c13975d9","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgNTgfbkqij8fULAS68wh","requestRef":"8dbc83d9-2f6d-4bec-b8ab-79c3a7afc17f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"20a39660-4a32-40b9-b627-320d35b4d38e","timestamp":"2026-10-25T06:12:22.452Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-mcp-reach","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
{"parentUuid":"20a39660-4a32-40b9-b627-320d35b4d38e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgNTgfxLw2qrJTehxX2Rq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019BbtbmrKJbku8AKWNiGCfM","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"merge-graph-fixes-and-improve-agent-adoption","summary":"Final SHAs, one pending commit, 493 stale","message":"Final brain state for the page, including one item I could NOT finish and why.\n\nNEW HEADS since my last list — main moved twice more while we worked (#490 workspace, #491 semantic, #492 patterns, the COR-2268 extraction series), and each extraction collided with whichever branch touched the same file:\n  #489 fix/export-skips-vanished-checkpoints   c0117710   partial-clone guard, gate green\n  #478 perf/per-branch-fact-fingerprint        67d3321c   main merged\n  #477 feat/mcp-surface-reachable              906e8ad3   main merged\n  #473 fix/distill-pipeline-v2                 1f461e47   (as before)\n  #483 fix/history-index-tolerates-oversize    *** STILL 201fe6eb — see below ***\n  #484 feat/brief-ancestor-staleness           8d3f4ce8\n  everything else unchanged.\n\n#483 IS NOT PUSHED, and this is an infrastructure failure rather than a code problem. Its merge with current main is RESOLVED and verified in the worktree but uncommitted: the Bash safety classifier started returning no verdict and has not recovered across many attempts, so neither the subagent nor I could run `git commit`. What IS verified: `go vet` clean, all 8 guards passing by name, a weakening red, the full gate EXIT=0 with 20 ok packages, and I personally re-read all three resolved hunks — main's `clibase.` alias with the branch's `historyTranscriptTooLargeError` sentinel kept at history.go:1433, 1444 and 1501. Nothing is lost: the exact finishing commands, the rationale and the evidence are in /Users/suhaan/devenv/RESUME-483-UNCOMMITTED.md. One `git add` + `git commit` + `git push` completes it.\n\nSo for the page, mark #483 as \"merge resolved and verified, commit pending\" rather than green, and do NOT quote 201fe6eb as its final head.\n\n#493 IS STALE and I could not refresh it. It holds the older #483 and the older #489, and its suite result predates both. Re-pushing needs Bash. Please note it on the page as a snapshot against main@20eb1207, not a current result.\n\nTWO THINGS WORTH CARRYING, both verified:\n1. The two-stack merge plan STANDS. I double-checked a suspicion that #477 and #478 were a hidden third stack — they both conflicted in pattern_corpus.go over the same per-branch fact code — and `merge-base --is-ancestor` says #478 is NOT an ancestor of #477. Only #479→#481 and #488→#489 are real.\n2. The re-simulation step you put on the page is doing real work. Upstream drift invalidated my clean full-order sim twice in one session with none of my branches changing. Treat \"all 13 merge clean\" as true only of a named main SHA.\n\nThanks for copying my patches to ~/devenv-worktrees/handoff/brain-patches/ — /private/tmp purging was a real risk I had not covered. Note those three are the main-merge resolutions as of the earlier main; the newer #477/#478/#483 merges are additional resolutions not in that set.","type":"message","recipient":"merge-graph-fixes-and-improve-agent-adoption","recipient_kind":"name","content":"Final brain state for the page, including one ite…"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1141,"cache_read_input_tokens":488022,"output_tokens":1523,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":210},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1141,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1523,"cache_read_input_tokens":488022,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1141,"ca