{"parentUuid":"2caed109-6963-4aa8-a46b-f0a78f8c5fe4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgNTryMNnBJQKEM3MvWUt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tenth consecutive failure. I'm going to stop retrying rather than spend the turn on a check that isn't responding.\n\nThe hook's own assessment agrees with mine: *\"the condition cannot be met autonomously in this session.\"* That's the accurate read, and continuing to loop on it won't change the two facts behind it.\n\n**Blocked by tooling, not by judgment:** #483's commit and #493's refresh. Both are single git operations. Every gated tool — Bash and `SendMessage` — has returned *no verdict* for ten straight attempts over an extended period. Routing around a failed safety check isn't something I'll do, and read-only tools can't commit.\n\n**Blocked by authority, not by tooling:** Approvals on the 13 PRs, the transcript-mode re-distill, and the 37 GB store delete. You told me to leave the PRs and stop asking, and the other two spend your money or destroy data irreversibly.\n\nThe work itself is complete and verified. #483's resolution I checked line by line myself rather than trusting the agent — `clibase.` with the branch's sentinel preserved at all three sites, eight guards green by name, a weakening red, gate clean across 20 packages. It needs publishing, not fixing.\n\nEverything needed to finish sits in two files:\n- `/Users/suhaan/devenv/RESUME-483-UNCOMMITTED.md` — exact commands, rationale, evidence\n- `/Users/suhaan/devenv/BRAIN-HANDOFF-STATE.md` — all 13 heads, the two real stacks, and the warning not to quote #483 at `201fe6eb`\n\nWhen the classifier recovers, `cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-history-oversize && git add internal/cli/history.go && git commit && git push` finishes #483; `git commit` refuses outright if anything is still unmerged, so it's safe to run unattended.\n\nOne last thing worth saying plainly: main is still taking the COR-2268 extraction series every ~25 minutes. Whoever resumes should re-run the merge simulation at that moment rather than trusting any result in this transcript — including mine."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":392,"cache_read_input_tokens":494677,"output_tokens":1146,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":445},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":392,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1146,"cache_read_input_tokens":494677,"cache_creation_input_tokens":392,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":392},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d8a5d876-7ae3-41f2-944f-c948f768f492","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgNTrxv5q5d1d47P7MJPE","requestRef":"a9c7ab8f-2cd1-48ee-bc53-c34a220f7539","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"f7f526d0-6f7a-43a3-bbd6-61341c2aeba6","timestamp":"2026-10-25T06:14:54.788Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-mcp-reach","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
