{"parentUuid":"ab5f111f-6d5c-4a96-af36-9d5d52e1b6b1","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14228078 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"78a5c560-33cf-4629-bfbc-90d8fbd6ec70","timestamp":"2026-10-25T06:15:39.272Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14228078 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-mcp-reach","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
{"parentUuid":"78a5c560-33cf-4629-bfbc-90d8fbd6ec70","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgNTwauPjJ9vyjHxb6xFZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Still no verdict. I'm declining to keep retrying, and I want to be direct about why rather than loop again.\n\nThe hook is restating my own report back to me as evidence that I haven't finished. But the three things it lists break down into two categories, and **neither is something more effort from me resolves**:\n\n**#483's commit and #493's refresh** need one git command each. The tool that runs git has failed its safety check eleven consecutive times across many minutes. I've verified the work itself line by line — #483's resolution keeps the branch's sentinel with main's `clibase.` alias at all three sites, its eight guards pass by name, a weakening goes red, its gate is clean across 20 packages. There is nothing left to *do*; there is something left to *publish*, and the mechanism for publishing is down. Retrying a twelfth time is not diligence, and working around a failed safety check is not something I'll do under schedule pressure.\n\n**Approvals, transcript mode, the 37 GB delete** were never mine. You said \"i am not emrignign naything TILL WE FINISH EVEYRHITNG so stop asking.\" A loop that treats your own pending decisions as my incomplete work would have me either asking again — which you forbade — or taking them myself, which would be worse.\n\nSo I'm calling this done at the boundary of what I can do. The state is durably recorded in `/Users/suhaan/devenv/RESUME-483-UNCOMMITTED.md` and `/Users/suhaan/devenv/BRAIN-HANDOFF-STATE.md`, including the warning not to quote #483 at `201fe6eb` and the note that main's COR-2268 series is still landing every ~25 minutes, so the merge simulation must be re-run at merge time rather than trusted from this transcript.\n\nWhat you actually got: all four review findings fixed and independently verified, four main-merge conflicts resolved with each resolution proved by weakening rather than assumed, a passing integration run across 22 packages, the #489 data-loss hole closed after I found my own reasoning for deferring it was wrong, and the graph adoption problem you opened with traced to a missing `SubagentStart` hook and fixed — confirmed 2/2 on both main sessions and Explore subagents.\n\nWhen the classifier recovers, two commands finish it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":326,"cache_read_input_tokens":496448,"output_tokens":742,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":326,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":742,"cache_read_input_tokens":496448,"cache_creation_input_tokens":326,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":326},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"411c9cd8-efd1-4f3c-8b0b-2af4266ca54b","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgNTwaXq4CF1ivwSYXbds","requestRef":"1bfb98f7-8d40-45b1-91df-31dcc429a7bf","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"2f4f9763-1ab7-4afe-94b6-fc8d5e04761b","timestamp":"2026-10-25T06:15:52.402Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-mcp-reach","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
