{"parentUuid":"04f72cfb-9225-4bf5-a86e-132ce0cf528f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgNV3yLokgtgTw5ib8zC5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PJF9ydZxr8GeZQhQiUkLLh","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-history-oversize; S=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce/scratchpad; gh pr view 493 --repo entireio/entire-brain --json body --jq .body > \"$S/pr493b.md\"; python3 - \"$S/pr493b.md\" <<'PY'\nimport sys\np=sys.argv[1]; s=open(p).read()\nold = s[s.index(\"## What this run does NOT cover\"):]\nnew = '''## CI closed the gap this branch was pushed for\n\n`-race` and Windows are the two things no local run in this session could reach, and they are\nthe reason this branch exists. On the combined tree, all green:\n\n| job | result |\n|---|---|\n| `test (ubuntu-latest)` | SUCCESS |\n| `test (macos-latest)` | SUCCESS |\n| `test (windows-latest)` — vet, compile and plan, shards 0-5, non-heavy packages, coverage and integrity | SUCCESS |\n| `lint` | SUCCESS |\n| `regression-mutations` | SUCCESS |\n\nSo every disclosed \"not verified locally\" caveat across the thirteen PRs — `-race`, Windows\npath separators, CRLF, platform-gated branches — is now covered on the *combined* tree rather\nthan PR by PR.\n\nOne operational note that is independent of these changes: `test:prepush` passes no `-timeout`\nwhile `internal/cli` runs 232s idle and 805-855s under parallel load, against `go test`'s 10m\ndefault. CI uses 20m. Under local parallel load the gate fails on correct code, and the panic\nnames whichever test happened to be running at the alarm. Use `GOFLAGS=-timeout=40m` locally.\n'''\nopen(p,\"w\").write(s.replace(old,new))\nprint(\"body updated with CI result\")\nPY\ngh pr edit 493 --repo entireio/entire-brain --body-file \"$S/pr493b.md\" >/dev/null && echo \"PR updated\"; cat > \"$S/bci.json\" <<'JSON'\n[{\"id\":\"integration-ci-green\",\"lane\":\"brain\",\"owner\":\"claude\",\"status\":\"done\",\n  \"title\":\"CI GREEN on the COMBINED tree of all 13 (#493 @4654e994): ubuntu + macos + windows (6 shards, vet, compile, coverage) + lint + regression-mutations all SUCCESS. This closes the -race/Windows gap EVERY agent and I had to disclose - no local run could reach it\"}]\nJSON\npython3 \"$S/board_update.py\" \"$S/bci.json\"","description":"Record the CI result"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":476,"cache_read_input_tokens":512181,"output_tokens":1255,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":244},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":476,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1255,"cache_read_input_tokens":512181,"cache_creation_input_tokens":476,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":476},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01PJF9ydZxr8GeZQhQiUkLLh":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-history-oversize; S=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce/scratchpad; gh pr view 493 --repo entireio/entire-brain --json body --jq .body > \"$S/pr493b.md\"; python3 - \"$S/pr493b.md\" <<'PY'\nimport sys\np=sys.argv[1]; s=open(p).read()\nold = s[s.index(\"## What this run does NOT cover\"):]\nnew = '''## CI closed the gap this branch was pushed for\n\n`-race` and Windows are the two things no local run in this session could reach, and they are\nthe reason this branch exists. On the combined tree, all green:\n\n| job | result |\n|---|---|\n| `test (ubuntu-latest)` | SUCCESS |\n| `test (macos-latest)` | SUCCE