{"parentUuid":"3ea03b64-47b0-43d8-9579-507bfb9ed62f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgNV5MHCQ4gAUT3RMj7am","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**CI is green on the combined tree of all thirteen PRs**, and that closes the last real gap in the work.\n\n```\ntest (ubuntu-latest)    SUCCESS\ntest (macos-latest)     SUCCESS\ntest (windows-latest)   SUCCESS  — vet, compile+plan, shards 0-5,\n                                   non-heavy packages, coverage+integrity\nlint                    SUCCESS\nregression-mutations    SUCCESS\n```\n\nEvery agent on this work, and I, had to disclose the same two caveats: **`-race` not run** and **Windows not run**. No local run could reach either. That's precisely why I pushed #493 rather than just reporting my own green suite — and it's now covered on the *combined* tree, not PR by PR. The Windows shards matter in particular, since path separators, CRLF checkouts and platform-gated branches have produced real bugs in my own tests before.\n\nSo the verification story is complete: 13 PRs individually green, the combined tree green locally across 25 packages, and the combined tree green in CI on three platforms including race detection.\n\nThat is the end of what I can do. The three remaining items — Approvals, transcript mode, the 37 GB delete — are yours, and I've explained why I won't take them on an automated check's prompting. If you want any of them done, say so and I'll do it immediately; a word from you is the one thing that changes my answer."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1308,"cache_read_input_tokens":512657,"output_tokens":452,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1308,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inf