{"parentUuid":"216fa87a-65b5-40fc-9614-caf0d438e277","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"7c26be97-c94f-428e-a706-2fe16601d92f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SZqsKG7bwpaQo2AWokhXkR","type":"tool_result","content":"id: 01M5SY8VHJKZ5JBEGJE3WKDAYE\nstatus: open\nseverity: medium\nbody: `digestHistorySessionInventoryFile` joins `historyTranscriptTooLargeError` with `finishErr` (the `validateAfterRead` containment and source-race check). `captureHistoryProjectionIdentityMode` then skips the file on `errors.Is(errHistoryTranscriptTooLarge)`. A transcript that is swapped or grows mid-read, or that becomes a symlink out of the root, is therefore silently dropped from the identity and the generation is published. `readHistorySessionInventoryFile` guards against this with `oversizeIsTheSoleFault`, but this path does not. Only attach the sentinel when `finishErr` is nil.\nreviewId: 01M5SY8VHE6WYB4DS0T2NJAHWY","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"608f0675-fb71-4d96-8ad2-24fd32e99b7a","timestamp":"2026-10-25T16:41:54.371Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"id: 01M5SY8VHJKZ5JBEGJE3WKDAYE\nstatus: open\nseverity: medium\nbody: `digestHistorySessionInventoryFile` joins `historyTranscriptTooLargeError` with `finishErr` (the `validateAfterRead` containment and source-race check). `captureHistoryProjectionIdentityMode` then skips the file on `errors.Is(errHistoryTranscriptTooLarge)`. A transcript that is swapped or grows mid-read, or that becomes a symlink out of the root, is therefore silently dropped from the identity and the generation is published. `readHistorySessionInventoryFile` guards against this with `oversizeIsTheSoleFault`, but this path does not. Only attach the sentinel when `finishErr` is nil.\nreviewId: 01M5SY8VHE6WYB4DS0T2NJAHWY","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"3ac9069c-c22b-4343-9bb3-e58f7ae9dc5d","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-history-ove