{"parentUuid":"c5f94902-a7cc-40e9-bcee-7f9e5e7956f5","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14681870 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"c5d55fbd-81d1-42f6-8a98-f24849f1e1f8","timestamp":"2026-10-25T16:59:09.905Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14681870 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-integ3","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
{"parentUuid":"c5d55fbd-81d1-42f6-8a98-f24849f1e1f8","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01DMg8sEp6icKLTFxco8u7wD","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"489d05f0-2797-4be0-81f1-399ea1019fe0","timestamp":"2026-10-25T16:59:19.580Z","session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-integ3","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
{"parentUuid":"489d05f0-2797-4be0-81f1-399ea1019fe0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgPK1jzQUBpWCCHDwM2MC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Correction: the \"23 passed\" I reported a moment ago was not this commit.** `45e7a626` had **zero** check-runs. Closing #493 stopped `pull_request` events on its branch, so my last two pushes got no CI at all — and `gh pr checks` happily reported the *old* head's results, which is how I came to repeat a stale green twice.\n\nFixed properly rather than by reopening the PR: `test.yml` carries a `workflow_dispatch` trigger with the comment *\"So anyone can ask 'is the evidence release-ready?' without cutting a tag.\"* Dispatched on the branch, and I verified the run's `headSha` equals `45e7a626` rather than trusting that it picked up the right commit. It's queued; I'm watching it.\n\nWhat *is* established on this exact tree:\n\n```\nlocal  go test ./...   exit 0 · 20 ok + 5 no-test = 25/25 · zero --- FAIL\n       go build        exit 0\n       gofmt -l -s     silent\n       merge order     all 13 clean on main a4942dd9\n```\n\nThe `-race` and Windows coverage is **not** established yet — that is precisely what the dispatched run is for, and it's the same gap I claimed closed an hour ago.\n\nTwo stale-green claims in one session, from the same root: reading a status that was *about something else* — a trail number scoped to the wrong repo earlier, a PR's check summary pinned to an older head now. The lesson I'll keep is to tie every green to the SHA it was measured on, which is why I checked `headSha` this time."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":487,"cache_read_input_tokens":317826,"output_tokens":512,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":487,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":512,"cache_read_input_tokens":317826,"cache_creation_input_tokens":487,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":487},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1f5caa60-d9ea-4a59-9211-28d383e9ef57","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgPK1jYs2RGQSDj2qKZrW","requestRef":"13528e94-c642-4a8f-b49f-be9272cdb6e3","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"b5147a09-0064-41e1-a8ce-5e013fb849e2","timestamp":"2026-10-25T16:59:19.580Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-integ3","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
