hree producers errHistoryTranscriptTooLarge ===\n rows: 10 distinct: 6\n  - When a sentinel error grants permission (skip, ignore, downgrade), fixing the site that ATTACHES it is right but assuming there is only one is the bug\n  - entire-brain history: FOUR readers of the canonical transcript inventory call readHistorySessionInventoryFile, not three. The oversize-transcript tole\n=== promisor probe definitive answer cache ===\n rows: 10 distinct: 3\n  - Capturing directory identity through an open handle was considered for Windows rename verification, but a real Windows probe showed the handle blocks \n  - Enabling semantic reranking failed the offline retrieval probe for 4dd458656: its solving fact fell from lexical rank 5 to outside the top 6 as adjace","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"68ac4114-2b96-4cc2-b694-9ca48135cdb5","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-integ3","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-integ3","branch":"tmp/integ6","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"entireio","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/entiredb","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/cli","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/entire.io","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd