rt":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-integ3","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
{"parentUuid":"fde43599-f21d-4d45-822b-d99088e1e9b6","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"25206d5c-9c80-42fe-b29b-45857e989158","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SrrzcTM55PTfzP73wYE5wr","type":"tool_result","content":"One `entire brain remember`, on **any** branch, re-indexed **every** session in the pattern corpus — \"even for byte-identical transcripts\", as the comment above the fingerprint already said. That rebuild runs inside the brain write lock, which is the same lock a retrieval holds to emit its response, so a concurrent `brief` or `brain_brief` failed `brain_locked` at ~10.5 s while it ran. Measured at **~18.7 s**, triggered on every `refresh` — which the watch daemon runs every tick.\n  → full link rebuild for EVERY session            (~18.7 s)\n  → held inside withLockedRetrievalPrivacyPolicies — the READERS' lock\n  → concurrent brain_brief fails brain_locked at ~10.5 s\n## The lock is deliberately untouched\nThe obvious alternative — build outside the lock and swap — is **incompatible with an existing test**. `TestPatternCorpusBuildCannotPublishAfterTombstoneLinearizes` (`pattern_privacy_publish_test.go:612`) asserts that a tombstone mutation *cannot acquire the lock* while a build is publishing:\n=== 481 full-run figure ===\nAt roughly 1.5s per child, about two and a half hours of subprocesses becomes","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"6fb94a5c-22a2-4570-ac1e-41eecdeedecd","timestamp":"2026-10-25T17:15:10.676Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"One `entire brain remember`, on **any** branch, re-indexed **every** session in the pattern corpus — \"even for byte-identical transcripts\", as the comment above the fingerprint already said. That rebuild runs inside the brain write lock, which is the same lock a retrieval holds to emit its response, so a concurrent `brief` or `brain_brief` failed `brain_locked` at ~10.5 s while it ran. Measured at **~18.7 s**, triggered on every `refresh` — which the watch daemon runs every tick.\n  → full link rebuild for EVERY session            (~18.7 s)\n  → held inside withLockedRetrievalPrivacyPolicies — the READERS' lock\n  → concurrent brain_brief fails brain_locked at ~10.5 s\n## The lock is deliberately untouched\nThe obvious alternative — build outside the lock and swap — is **incompatible with an existing test**. `TestPatternCorpusBuildCannotPublishAfterTombstoneLinearizes` (`pattern_privacy_publish_test.go:612`) asserts that a tombstone mutation *cannot acquire the lock* while a build is publishing:\n=== 481 full-run figure ===\nAt roughly 1.5s per child, about two and a half hours of subprocesses becomes","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"f337df06-b38c-4877-9869-0d3c19370559","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-integ3","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-integ3","branch":"tmp/integ6","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"entireio","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/entiredb","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/cli","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/entire.io","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-integ3","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fde43599-f21d-4d45-822b-d99088e1e9