{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-25T17:17:26.142Z","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","content":"once done please make a update like this; humans tlyel ;\n\n<pasted_content id=\"ecd9\">\nEvis  [1:41 AM]\nWas hoping to get the release out today but it's getting late my time and will do it tomorrow after a few more improvements merge!\n\n\nupdated launch blog\ndeployed brainstore to all available regions\nstarted working on making memories editable in trail and memories page\nsped up cold graph runs from 70s -> 30s\n\n\n*entireio/entire-brain*\n• :merged: Minimum CLI version for connect — https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/328\n• :merged: Renamed facts to memories — https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/330\n• :merged: Daemon restarts on binary replacement — https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/331\n• :merged: Session export survives diverged transcripts — https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/329\n\n*entireio/entire-graph*\n• :merged: Provider-record cache spools to disk — https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-graph/trails/264\n\n*entirehq/brainstore*\n• :merged: Brainstore images promoted to production — https://entire.io/et/entirehq/brainstore/trails/26\n\n*entirehq/fleet*\n• :merged: Brainstore and merge relay AU/SG prep — https://entire.io/gh/entirehq/fleet/trails/8593\n\n*entirehq/infra*\n• :merged: Aurora config for Singapore Brainstore — https://entire.io/gh/entirehq/infra/trails/1499\n</pasted_content id=\"ecd9\">\n\n| and icnldeu grpahs works too"}
