{"parentUuid":"61041890-84bb-4d67-a20b-208a2fc22c34","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgPMQrEL6u2w7DUMTWH6w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Confirmed the mechanism exactly, and the finding is **real**: at `transcript_cache_migration.go:57` a cached file whose session is absent from the manifest hits `continue`, is never added to `retained`, and therefore lands in the sweep set at line 100. So dropping a skipped session from `manifest.Sessions` marks its cache for deletion.\n\nThe naive fix is wrong, though — `!live` also covers sessions removed by `privacy exclude`, whose caches **must** be swept. Checking what the partition actually returns."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1583,"cache_read_input_tokens":407537,"output_tokens":2028,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1717},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1583,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2028,"cache_read_input_tokens":407537,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1583,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1583},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f679b847-9d10-4aa7-9a03-5490a6a08feb","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgPMQqskFq13xbWJcEUrR","requestRef":"bce72212-5c09-414a-b177-9f752c2fae71","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"b70346f2-4e90-49f5-bb11-bbb7b6a54f8a","timestamp":"2026-10-25T17:31:04.023Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd