{"parentUuid":"eb2d7501-f2a3-48c0-98a0-cefa4c2d1dfc","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"277f4010-c905-4571-a382-13f01d0c94a2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HumuBXUnRiUcSmvkoRUE6x","type":"tool_result","content":"OPEN 01M5T336CJ8HSWH6ANM71CHHAJ medium\nSessions with no snapshot entry or chunks are now silently skipped (only a warning) as long as one other session is usable. In a partial clone or with unsynced checkpoint refs, this \"not in snapshot\" case is recoverable by sync, but unlike the object-missing path it is not gated by `gitDirHasPromisorRemote`. The export can republish a shrunken corpus where it previously refused with \"sync checkpoints and retry\".","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"00a87085-af1c-4eb7-972f-5a7a53559898","timestamp":"2026-10-25T17:54:29.204Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"OPEN 01M5T336CJ8HSWH6ANM71CHHAJ medium\nSessions with no snapshot entry or chunks are now silently skipped (only a warning) as long as one other session is usable. In a partial clone or with unsynced checkpoint refs, this \"not in snapshot\" case is recoverable by sync, but unlike the object-missing path it is not gated by `gitDirHasPromisorRemote`. The export can republish a shrunken corpus where it previously refused with \"sync checkpoints and retry\".","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"0ecba639-0394-429f-a4d1-0fa3f7a878da","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-vanished","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-vanished","branch":"fix/export-skips-vanished-checkpoints","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"entireio","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"