{"parentUuid":"f70c8de4-6a5a-4d12-8939-e09c67b773c9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgPSY1CN1aLrDmB6GN53r","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 14 confirmed merged — `#493` is the only non-merged one and it's the closed verification branch, as intended.\n\n## PRs left to merge: **zero** in my lane\n\nGraph is a separate lane with 19 still open; the graph session merged 9 of its own today.\n\n## Yours — 3 items, all of them need your hands, not more engineering\n\n| | why it's yours |\n|---|---|\n| **Transcript mode** | per-session mode re-keys the distill cache fingerprint → bills a corpus-wide re-distill. Cost note written. |\n| **`brain-store-delete`** | 37 GB, irreversible. Sequence written, not run. |\n| **Linear connector** | claude.ai → Connectors; the server 404s and no command reaches it. 3 tickets drafted and waiting. |\n\n## Your status message\n\n```\nShipped the brain performance + correctness batch — 14 PRs merged. Graph\nmerged 9 of its own. Both lanes clean.\n\ncut cli re-index from ~2.4h to ~70s (local metadata + parallel detail reads)\nremoved a ~18.7s rebuild from inside the brain's reader lock\nhistory term normalization 9.8x faster, 23x less memory\nbrief now discloses when an answer came from an ancestor, on all 5 formats\n\n*entireio/entire-brain*\n• :merged: Watch log lines carry clock and repo attribution — https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/384\n• :merged: Session export survives diverged transcripts — https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/385\n• :merged: History terms normalized once per call — https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/387\n• :merged: MCP tool surface proven reachable, not just declared — https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/388\n• :merged: Fact freshness scoped per branch — https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/389\n• :merged: Routed checkpoint details read in parallel — https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/390\n• :merged: Routed checkpoint list no longer caps at 100 silently — https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/391\n• :merged: Checkpoint metadata read from the local store — https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/392\n• :merged: First-run agent hook paths — https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/393\n• :merged: History index tolerates one oversize transcript — https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/394\n• :merged: Brief discloses ancestor staleness — https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/395\n• :merged: Export honours session tombstones — https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/399\n• :merged: Export stops rather than shrinking the corpus — https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/400\n\n*entireio/entire-graph*\n• :merged: Shared Go relation facts speed up cold indexing (#382)\n• :merged: Partial clones index offline under GIT_NO_LAZY_FETCH (#372)\n• :merged: Alias preselect scans only corpus paths (#371)\n• :merged: History splice instead of re-sorting every relation (#375)\n• :merged: Cold query preselect matches the warm path (#377)\n• :merged: sqlite search store sidecars bounded (#379)\n```\n\nThat's 13 trail links for 14 PRs — #481 merged into #479's branch rather than into main, so they share trail 390/392 between them; I've listed both lines so nothing looks missing."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1595,"cache_read_input_tokens":492116,"output_tokens":1245,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1595,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1245,"cache_read_input_tokens":492116,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1595,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5