{"parentUuid":"404dcba7-9ec1-4dd0-82af-a78df1a7e801","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"de45c123-4123-4eae-b552-c91e8af48df3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01U4zG4FJYEXbG4KHykC9iQE","type":"tool_result","content":"88\t\t\t\t// which sessions it has. Its list arrives with the membership\n89\t\t\t\t// list, which costs nothing extra, and every session on it has to\n90\t\t\t\t// be one the local store actually read. A session Entire declares\n91\t\t\t\t// and the local refs cannot resolve MUST reach the detail path,\n92\t\t\t\t// because that is what refuses the export instead of silently\n93\t\t\t\t// shipping a smaller one (TestFilelessRoutedCatalogUsesLocal-\n94\t\t\t\t// Identities pins exactly that).\n95\t\t\t\t//\n96\t\t\t\t// An entry with no declared sessions cannot be cross-checked —\n97\t\t\t\t// older hosts omit the field, and the host also omits it for the\n98\t\t\t\t// remote checkpoints whose metadata it could not load, which are\n99\t\t\t\t// precisely the ones that need asking. Fail closed and ask.\n100\t\t\t\tif len(entry.SessionIDs) == 0 {\n101\t\t\t\t\tcontinue\n102\t\t\t\t}\n103\t\t\t\tmissing := false\n104\t\t\t\tfor _, sessionID := range entry.SessionIDs {\n105\t\t\t\t\tif _, ok := sessions[sessionID]; !ok {\n106\t\t\t\t\t\tmissing = true\n107\t\t\t\t\t\tbreak\n108\t\t\t\t\t}\n109\t\t\t\t}\n110\t\t\t\tif missing {\n111\t\t\t\t\tcontinue\n112\t\t\t\t}\n113\t\t\t}\n114\t\t\tcovered[entry.CheckpointID] = struct{}{}\n115\t\t}\n116\t\tif len(covered) == 0 {\n117\t\t\treturn nil, nil\n118\t\t}\n119\t\treturn &localCheckpointMetadata{selected: snapshot.Selected, covered: covered}, nil"}]},"uuid":"244fd2db-cfdc-4115-a1d8-2df4de04b070","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:39:44.706Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-integ3/internal/cli/export_local_metadata.go","content":"\t\t\t// which sessions it has. Its list arrives with the membership\n\t\t\t// list, which costs nothing extra, and every session on it has to\n\t\t\t// be one the local store actually read. A session Entire declares\n\t\t\t// and the local refs cannot resolve MUST reach the detail path,\n\t\t\t// because that is what refuses the export instead of silently\n\t\t\t// shipping a smaller one (TestFilelessRoutedCatalogUsesLocal-\n\t\t\t// Identities pins exactly that).\n\t\t\t//\n\t\t\t// An entry with no declared sessions cannot be cross-checked —\n\t\t\t// older hosts omit the field, and the host also omits it for the\n\t\t\t// remote checkpoints whose metadata it could not load, which are\n\t\t\t// precisely the ones that need asking. Fail closed and ask.\n\t\t\tif len(entry.SessionIDs) == 0 {\n\t\t\t\tcontinue\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tmissing := false\n\t\t\tfor _, sessionID := range entry.SessionIDs {\n\t\t\t\tif _, ok := sessions[sessionID]; !ok {\n\t\t\t\t\tmissing = true\n\t\t\t\t\tbreak\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tif missing {\n\t\t\t\tcontinue\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\tcovered[entry.CheckpointID] = struct{}{}\n\t}\n\tif len(covered) == 0 {\n\t\treturn nil, nil\n\t}\n\treturn &localCheckpointMetadata{selected: snapshot.Selected, covered: covered}, nil","numLines":32,"startLine":88,"totalLines":162}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"404dcba7-9ec1-4dd0-82af-a78df1a7e801","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-integ3","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
