{"parentUuid":"e58ccb29-76d7-4559-ba6c-9144a8ba8e8f","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14974999 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"590bbe90-2b8b-453c-b288-e4418e1acc0b","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:44:41.883Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14974999 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-integ3","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
{"parentUuid":"590bbe90-2b8b-453c-b288-e4418e1acc0b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgPT4W7FZzbJn2tYXk2jF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Correction, and it affects the message I gave you to paste: the batch is 13 PRs, not 14.**\n\nI verified it rather than take either count on faith — iterating the batch gives **13 total, 13 merged**, plus #493 closed. #484 was always one of the 13; I'd been counting it as an extra. And at one point I told you \"13 of 13 merged\" while #484 was still open, which was actually 12.\n\n**So in the status message, change the first line to \"13 PRs merged.\"** Everything else in it is correct — the trail links, the numbers, the graph section. The 13 trail links map 1:1 to the 13 PRs, which is the detail that should have caught my arithmetic earlier: I'd explained away \"13 links for 14 PRs\" with a story about #481 sharing a trail, when the real reason was that there were only ever 13.\n\nTwo other things settled:\n\n- **The trail-390 fix doesn't touch graph's `context` contract** — it's entirely inside brain's export path (`export_local_metadata.go`, the `seed`/`covered` pair). No graph call, no `--allow-ancestor`, no capability key. So nothing is held on it.\n- **#484's disclosure is dormant until a graph nightly is cut.** Until then its consumer sees the capability as absent and takes the asserted safe path. Nothing's broken, but don't read its merge as the feature being live — that's now a user-owned item on the graph side too.\n\nYour list is unchanged: transcript mode, the 37 GB delete, the Linear connector — plus that graph nightly cut, which is also yours."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1287,"cache_read_input_tokens":514690,"output_tokens":515,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1287,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":515,"cache_read_input_tokens":514690,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1287,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1287},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"bab9af9a-92cb-42a1-b533-6ef6954f39f0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgPT4Vneo3kGf4x8oERUD","requestRef":"1fbb7b26-a9a7-4001-ad35-57ed36d616f6","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"a49c18bb-3b46-4223-8bcd-59ce7d2e1d30","timestamp":"2026-10-25T18:44:50.096Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-integ3","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
